  else
cat <<EOF
============ $ICON_AUDIO Download Audio =============
1) Enter video/playlist URL
2) Choose save folder (default: $SAVE_PATH)
3) Select audio format (mp3/ogg/m4a/opus/flac/wav)
4) Audio quality (high/medium/low)
5) Auto tag/fetch metadata? (yes/no)
